# Everything under documents/ is local working notes EXCEPT the requirements /
# progress log itself: the project rules make documents/PROJECT_PROGRESS.md the
# single source of truth, and a source of truth that no one can diff or lose is
# worse than no source of truth (28.5). Re-include it after the wildcard.
documents/*
!documents/PROJECT_PROGRESS.md

# The 32 MB ffmpeg.wasm Stage-2 fallback asset is kept out of git (28.7): it is
# a browser download for the rare mediabunny failure path, and this repo is
# cloned and git-pulled (by start.sh) on every deploy. Copy it once by hand -
# see README ("Run"). create_app logs a warning when it is absent.
app/static/js/ffmpeg/ffmpeg-core.wasm
